 "audit": "Old .jsp URL redirects to the homepage and /help/size-charts 404s; charts are in each product's VIEW SIZE CHART. Bust from Women's Tops, hip from Women's Bottoms (Classic); natural waist is identical on both in inches. Inch tables used, x2.54, originals in _in, because the CM views disagree on waist: size 16 87.5 (Tops) vs 94 (Bottoms) where 35.5 in = 90.2; also size 00 61 vs 62, size 0 63.5 vs 64. UK from the guide's Size Conversion tab, which stops at US 20 (so none for US 22, 24), and labels XL 16-18 and XXL 20 where the measurement tables have XL 16, XXL / 1X 18, 2X 20; altLabel follows the measurement tables. Old M (UK 10, US 6) 90/70/94 now US 8 (M, UK 12) 94/73.7/99.1. Some styles' charts are garment measurements instead (e.g. jersey mockneck CZ988, chest 39 at XS)."
